风，无任何文字，无任何人物。\n\n背景：深蓝黑色渐变，从左上深蓝黑过渡到右下蓝紫微光，铺满细微的发光科技网格纹理，网格线极淡、若隐若现；画面中漂浮着少量蓝白色光尘粒子；四角有轻微暗角。\n\n右侧视觉区：画面右侧偏下悬浮一块微微倾斜约3度的矩形面板，深色玻璃质感带厚度和银色细边框，面板内部是接近黑色的空屏幕，屏幕边缘泛着淡蓝色辉光；面板下方在深色桌面上映出柔和反光，面板背后有淡淡的蓝紫色体积光晕。\n\n左侧大字区：画面左侧约五分之二区域保持干净，只有渐变底色和少量光尘，无任何物体，留出大面积负空间。\n\n光效冷静高级，科技感强，2K细节。画面中无任何文字，无任何人物。", "", 1024], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 682, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image_1", "label": "参考图 1 (Image-1)", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "参考图 1 (Image-1)"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "negative_prompt"}, "name": "negative_prompt", "label": "negative_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "negative_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution"}], "flags": {}, "id": 477, "type": "TextEncodeQwenImage21", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImage21"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "resized", "links": [712, 722], "label": "resized", "type": "*", "localized_name": "resized"}], "size": [210, 106], "pos": [373.75927734375, 2757.4599609375], "widgets_values": ["scale by multiplier", 2, "lanczos"], "inputs": [{"name": "input", "link": 731, "label": "input", "type": "IMAGE,MASK", "localized_name": "input"}, {"widget": {"name": "resize_type"}, "name": "resize_type", "label": "resize_type", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "resize_type"}, {"widget": {"name": "resize_type.multiplier"}, "name": "resize_type.multiplier", "label": "resize_type.multiplier", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "multiplier"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_method"}, "name": "scale_method", "label": "scale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_n